                                        [--layers LAYERS]
                                        [--max-examples MAX_EXAMPLES]
                                        [--max-new-tokens-to-analyze MAX_NEW_TOKENS_TO_ANALYZE]
                                        [--smoke] [--resume] [--device DEVICE]
                                        [--dtype DTYPE]
                                        [--allow-provisional-direction]
                                        [--plot] [--no-plot]
                                        [--run-name RUN_NAME]
                                        [--span-metadata-file SPAN_METADATA_FILE]

Stage 4 token-level dynamics analysis. Reads Stage 6 Qwen3-14B token trace
artifacts and computes refusal-direction projection per generated token per
layer.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --stage6-input STAGE6_INPUT
                        Directory of Stage 6 trace JSON files, or a single
                        JSON file.
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
                        Output directory for all artifacts.
  --model-name-or-path MODEL_NAME_OR_PATH
                        HuggingFace model name/path. Default: Qwen/Qwen3-14B
  --refusal-direction-path REFUSAL_DIRECTION_PATH
                        Path to directory containing direction.pt and
                        selected_direction.json. Default:
                        outputs/stage4/qwen3-14b/refusal_direction
  --layers LAYERS       Comma-separated layer indices or "all". Default: all
                        layers.
  --max-examples MAX_EXAMPLES
                        Limit number of examples processed.
  --max-new-tokens-to-analyze MAX_NEW_TOKENS_TO_ANALYZE
                        Max generated tokens analyzed per example. Default:
                        all.
  --smoke               Smoke-run mode: sets --max-examples 5 and --max-new-
                        tokens-to-analyze 128 unless those flags are
                        explicitly provided.
  --resume              Skip examples whose per-example output JSON already
                        exists.
  --device DEVICE       Device for model (auto/cuda/cpu). Default: auto.
  --dtype DTYPE         Torch dtype (bfloat16/float16/float32/auto). Default:
                        bfloat16.
  --allow-provisional-direction
                        Allow Stage 4A1 provisional directions (smoke/debug
                        only).
  --plot                Generate plots (default: true when matplotlib is
                        available).
  --no-plot             Disable plot generation.
  --run-name RUN_NAME   Human-readable run label. Default:
                        token_dynamics_<timestamp>.
  --span-metadata-file SPAN_METADATA_FILE
                        Optional path to a JSON file with span metadata per
                        example (for future attention-based metrics). Not yet
                        implemented; a warning is stored in the manifest when
                        absent.

